---
import DocsLayout from "@/layouts/DocsLayout.astro";
---

<DocsLayout title="Navigation Basics">
  <h1>Navigation basics</h1>
  <p class="muted">A quick mental model of the workspace.</p>

  <h2>File explorer</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Browse your vault as a folder/file tree.</li>
    <li>Create, rename, delete, and drag & drop to organize.</li>
    <li>Expanded folders and scroll position persist across sessions.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Tabs & panels</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Notes open in tabs.</li>
    <li>Additional panels (Canvas, Kanban, Terminal) are available via the command palette.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Command palette</h2>
  <p>
    Open the command palette with <span class="kbd">Cmd/Ctrl</span> + <span class="kbd">P</span>.
  </p>
</DocsLayout>

